WEBVTT

02:21.890 --> 02:25.650
<b>Episode 6
"Punch"</b>

02:48.910 --> 02:50.100
<i>Kakeru-kun.</i>

02:58.660 --> 02:59.900
<b>Oh, morning.</b>

03:04.520 --> 03:06.020
<b>How about some tea?</b>

03:06.020 --> 03:07.620
<b>You should take a break.</b>

03:13.000 --> 03:13.780
<b>Morning.</b>

03:14.080 --> 03:14.960
<b>Morning.</b>

03:14.960 --> 03:16.190
<b>Did I wake you up?</b>

03:16.910 --> 03:17.550
<b>No.</b>

03:28.830 --> 03:30.100
<i>There you are.</i>

03:31.210 --> 03:32.590
<i>I was looking for you.</i>

03:33.560 --> 03:35.290
<b>I've always been here.</b>

03:40.170 --> 03:41.900
<b>I'm still a little sleepy.</b>

03:49.100 --> 03:50.460
<b>There was a line in a movie:</b>

03:50.460 --> 03:53.190
<b>"If a girl of age is sleeping on her stomach,</b>

03:53.190 --> 03:56.200
<b>it's because she's in love."</b>

03:58.290 --> 04:01.990
<b>Though, I think a parent 
can tell regardless.</b>

04:04.140 --> 04:05.080
<b>But...</b>

04:05.840 --> 04:08.750
<b>There aren't any romance movies 
called "You Know What Happens Next",</b>

04:08.750 --> 04:10.470
<b>are there?</b>

04:10.800 --> 04:11.980
<b>You know what happens?</b>

04:12.550 --> 04:16.400
<b>No, I don't. But what if I did?</b>

04:16.400 --> 04:18.120
<b>Would it be boring?</b>

04:18.860 --> 04:21.310
<b>I don't know what you're talking about,</b>

04:21.690 --> 04:24.300
<b>but if you did, you could enjoy it twice.</b>

04:25.650 --> 04:27.870
<b>Wow, Mom.</b>

04:28.140 --> 04:30.200
<b>Even if you knew about</b>

04:30.200 --> 04:32.260
<b>a future that's a bit sad,</b>

04:32.260 --> 04:34.550
<b>at least you can prepare for it.</b>

04:35.100 --> 04:36.170
<b>So many perks.</b>

04:39.760 --> 04:41.640
<i>"Enjoy it twice," huh?</i>

04:41.940 --> 04:43.120
<i>That might be nice.</i>

04:43.820 --> 04:45.610
<i>I could enjoy the feeling of</i>

04:45.610 --> 04:48.180
<i>making a good piece twice.</i>

04:48.180 --> 04:49.600
<i>And in love...</i>

04:51.030 --> 04:53.300
<i>In love—</i>

05:06.190 --> 05:07.150
<b>Are you okay?</b>

05:08.240 --> 05:10.030
<b>I'm fine. It was a bug.</b>

05:11.280 --> 05:12.370
<b>I think.</b>

05:12.880 --> 05:14.310
<b>A bug?</b>

05:14.310 --> 05:16.030
<b>Just a bug, huh?</b>

05:16.030 --> 05:18.780
<b>She's a good girl, being that she's our girl,</b>

05:18.780 --> 05:20.660
<b>but she's of age, so, y'know.</b>

05:20.660 --> 05:22.420
<b>Of age?!</b>

05:30.330 --> 05:31.940
<b>Hello, Touko?</b>

05:32.950 --> 05:34.180
<b>It's Okikura.</b>

05:34.180 --> 05:35.240
<b>Can you talk?</b>

05:35.240 --> 05:36.080
<i>Yes!</i>

05:36.440 --> 05:39.590
<b>I never got a chance to hear what you 
wanted to talk about the other day.</b>

05:39.590 --> 05:42.510
<b>I, um, I'll call you back.</b>

05:49.510 --> 05:51.080
<b>I hung up.</b>

05:52.560 --> 05:53.500
<b>What's up?</b>

05:53.810 --> 05:55.280
<b>She just hung up on me.</b>

05:55.280 --> 05:56.560
<b>That girl from before?</b>

05:56.560 --> 05:57.730
<b>I'll make coffee.</b>

05:58.130 --> 06:00.350
<b>Did you mess up?</b>

06:01.220 --> 06:03.880
<b>I can't experience my first kiss twice.</b>

06:03.880 --> 06:05.420
<b>I can't do it.</b>

06:05.420 --> 06:06.840
<b>I can't.</b>

06:06.840 --> 06:08.460
<b>My heart will burst.</b>

06:10.010 --> 06:11.970
<b>Okikura-kun, sorry about earlier.</b>

06:12.200 --> 06:13.650
<i>Sorry, it's Hiro.</i>

06:17.220 --> 06:18.390
<i>Are you okay?</i>

06:18.390 --> 06:20.800
<i>I wanted to talk to you</i>

06:20.800 --> 06:22.540
<i>about the get-together today.</i>

06:22.900 --> 06:24.130
<i>Huh, are you listening?</i>

06:29.370 --> 06:29.910
<b>'Sup.</b>

06:33.360 --> 06:34.920
<b>Breakfast's ready.</b>

06:34.920 --> 06:36.100
<b>Okay.</b>

06:41.130 --> 06:44.880
<b>Crap, I can't be like this forever.</b>

06:45.870 --> 06:47.640
<b>How am I supposed to present myself?</b>

06:52.720 --> 06:54.500
<b>Morning, sleepy-head.</b>

06:54.500 --> 06:56.350
<b>You couldn't hear Mom calling?</b>

06:57.680 --> 06:59.100
<b>I was getting changed.</b>

06:59.100 --> 07:01.790
<b>Oh. Breakfast's going to get cold. Hurry.</b>

07:04.450 --> 07:05.390
<b>Hey.</b>

07:05.690 --> 07:06.650
<b>What?</b>

07:06.950 --> 07:09.650
<b>I have to swing by somewhere 
before we go to Kazemichi.</b>

07:09.650 --> 07:11.190
<b>Got it.</b>

07:25.430 --> 07:26.340
<b>I actually</b>

07:26.580 --> 07:28.840
<b>had you come early, Touko-san.</b>

07:29.240 --> 07:31.090
<b>Me? Really?</b>

07:31.090 --> 07:31.980
<b>Yeah.</b>

07:32.380 --> 07:33.410
<b>About before—</b>

07:33.410 --> 07:35.140
<b>I heard you were at Sacchan's place.</b>

07:37.640 --> 07:41.620
<b>Maybe she wanted me to know about you.</b>

07:42.470 --> 07:45.360
<b>But she couldn't say it straight out.</b>

07:45.790 --> 07:47.750
<b>Y-You think so?</b>

07:48.930 --> 07:52.070
<b>But don't tell Yukinari 
and Yanagi-san about it.</b>

07:52.480 --> 07:54.220
<b>What? Everyone already kno—</b>

07:55.150 --> 07:57.610
<b>I want to tell them myself.</b>

07:58.300 --> 07:59.860
<b>Sure, of course.</b>

08:06.040 --> 08:08.340
<b>It's so hot.</b>

08:07.480 --> 08:08.340
<b>Got it.</b>

08:09.860 --> 08:11.380
<b>I did it. I confessed.</b>

08:17.030 --> 08:18.350
<b>Good for you, Yana-chan.</b>

08:21.210 --> 08:25.160
<b>I like how you're missing
just a little bit of tact.</b>

08:28.430 --> 08:29.440
<b>How've you been?</b>

08:29.440 --> 08:31.050
<b>I don't like the heat.</b>

08:29.570 --> 08:30.300
<b>Hey.</b>

08:37.980 --> 08:40.620
<b>Let's get straight to it.</b>

08:40.620 --> 08:41.710
<b>Where's Sachi?</b>

08:42.070 --> 08:45.300
<b>Yeah, it's about Sacchan.</b>

08:46.330 --> 08:47.710
<b>So it's a surprise?</b>

08:47.970 --> 08:49.240
<b>Yep.</b>

08:49.240 --> 08:52.250
<b>Remember when she couldn't go 
to the fireworks with us last time?</b>

08:52.250 --> 08:56.190
<b>So I thought, maybe we could set up 
fireworks so that she could come, too.</b>

08:57.720 --> 08:58.800
<b>Don't you think?</b>

08:59.060 --> 09:00.700
<b>I do. I like that.</b>

09:00.700 --> 09:01.220
<b>Let's do that.</b>

09:01.530 --> 09:03.100
<b>We have exams coming up.</b>

09:03.100 --> 09:05.530
<b>I think we're having too many outings.</b>

09:05.830 --> 09:06.820
<b>Oh well.</b>

09:07.120 --> 09:09.420
<b>I'll let Sacchan know.</b>

09:12.080 --> 09:13.160
<b>Sorry.</b>

09:14.950 --> 09:16.300
<b>Hello?</b>

09:17.210 --> 09:19.180
<b>She could talk here.</b>

09:19.180 --> 09:21.000
<b>Maybe she can't.</b>

09:21.300 --> 09:22.100
<b>I wonder who?</b>

09:22.100 --> 09:23.390
<b>David, probably?</b>

09:23.390 --> 09:24.150
<b>Dude.</b>

09:24.150 --> 09:27.370
<b>Oh, we can get a hold of him. 
Why don't we invite him, too?</b>

09:27.990 --> 09:29.910
<b>You mean, get Touko to invite him?</b>

09:29.910 --> 09:32.050
<b>Why don't I, then?</b>

09:32.050 --> 09:33.110
<b>I will.</b>

09:33.110 --> 09:33.630
<b>Huh?</b>

09:34.200 --> 09:36.010
<b>I know where he lives, I think.</b>

09:36.360 --> 09:37.810
<b>Why, though?</b>

09:37.810 --> 09:38.990
<b>Sorry.</b>

09:40.040 --> 09:41.660
<b>Touko-san, we were saying</b>

09:41.660 --> 09:44.220
<b>maybe we should invite David-kun.</b>

09:45.230 --> 09:46.060
<b>Why?</b>

09:46.930 --> 09:48.060
<b>It just kind of happened.</b>

10:02.220 --> 10:02.850
<i>Yes?</i>

10:03.150 --> 10:05.180
<b>I'm Imi, Okikura-kun's—</b>

10:05.180 --> 10:05.790
<i>Hold on.</i>

10:12.850 --> 10:14.130
<b>I'm surprised you found my house.</b>

10:14.650 --> 10:17.750
<b>Okikura is a famous name around here.</b>

10:18.230 --> 10:19.040
<b>Want to come in?</b>

10:19.650 --> 10:21.760
<b>If you have time, I want to talk outside.</b>

10:46.860 --> 10:50.000
<b>I'm a complete idiot.</b>

10:57.120 --> 10:58.920
<i>Hello, Okikura here.</i>

10:59.280 --> 11:01.550
<b>My name is Fukami.</b>

11:01.550 --> 11:03.430
<b>Is Oki... Kakeru-kun—</b>

11:03.660 --> 11:05.620
<i>Kakeru just went out.</i>

11:05.620 --> 11:06.680
<b>I see.</b>

11:07.270 --> 11:09.640
<i>Is Imi-kun a friend of yours, too?</i>

11:09.640 --> 11:11.290
<b>Yes, well...</b>

11:15.520 --> 11:17.570
<b>I didn't really want to invite you.</b>

11:18.790 --> 11:20.810
<b>Then you don't have to.</b>

11:20.810 --> 11:21.990
<b>What's the problem?</b>

11:22.290 --> 11:26.210
<b>You can't just do the things that you want 
to do. That's not how the world works.</b>

11:27.030 --> 11:27.960
<b>I see.</b>

11:28.400 --> 11:29.160
<b>So, what?</b>

11:29.730 --> 11:31.670
<b>We're going to the fireworks, 
the usual group.</b>

11:32.120 --> 11:33.310
<b>I'm inviting you.</b>

11:33.610 --> 11:34.640
<b>I see,</b>

11:35.160 --> 11:36.760
<b>so you didn't want to invite me,</b>

11:37.060 --> 11:39.640
<b>but you didn't have a choice.</b>

11:39.640 --> 11:40.350
<b>Yeah.</b>

11:41.160 --> 11:42.400
<b>Then I'll decline.</b>

11:42.750 --> 11:45.100
<b>No reason to cause a stir.</b>

11:45.400 --> 11:48.350
<b>You caused a huge stir 
the moment you arrived.</b>

11:48.830 --> 11:49.810
<b>I figured.</b>

11:50.170 --> 11:51.680
<b>Are you doing it on purpose?</b>

11:52.170 --> 11:53.250
<b>Somewhat.</b>

11:53.950 --> 11:54.770
<b>Are you enjoying it?</b>

11:55.600 --> 11:58.770
<b>Of course not. It's circumstantial.</b>

11:58.770 --> 12:01.240
<b>Just like you, I'm not doing 
it because I want to.</b>

12:01.820 --> 12:03.360
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

12:03.360 --> 12:05.410
<b>What's your relationship with Touko?</b>

12:05.740 --> 12:08.160
<b>Haven't you realized how Touko feels?</b>

12:09.240 --> 12:11.410
<b>I haven't heard anything from Touko.</b>

12:12.090 --> 12:13.960
<b>And I have no reason to tell you.</b>

12:15.700 --> 12:16.820
<b>You...</b>

12:20.430 --> 12:22.220
<b>Hey, wait!</b>

12:23.810 --> 12:25.760
<b>Did Takayama confess to you?</b>

12:27.150 --> 12:29.720
<b>You mean to tell me you 
haven't answered her yet?</b>

12:49.050 --> 12:51.850
<b>I think we should skip 
inviting Kakeru-kun this time!</b>

13:05.070 --> 13:06.090
<b>What happened?</b>

13:09.700 --> 13:11.460
<b>Let's just say it hurt.</b>

13:11.460 --> 13:12.640
<b>Why did you—</b>

13:13.560 --> 13:14.440
<b>No...</b>

13:14.820 --> 13:16.770
<b>No! No way. Was it Yuki-kun?</b>

13:17.090 --> 13:17.880
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:17.880 --> 13:19.050
<b>Oh, no.</b>

13:19.050 --> 13:20.770
<b>No, I said too much.</b>

13:22.330 --> 13:25.820
<b>It seems Takayama told him how she felt.</b>

13:26.790 --> 13:29.530
<b>I wonder if I'm being awful to Yuki-kun.</b>

13:31.940 --> 13:32.820
<b>I don't know.</b>

13:33.200 --> 13:36.420
<b>Honestly, there are a lot of things 
I don't understand lately.</b>

13:37.320 --> 13:39.170
<b>We all chipped in.</b>

13:39.730 --> 13:41.110
<b>Fireworks.</b>

13:41.110 --> 13:42.050
<b>I like those.</b>

13:42.380 --> 13:44.510
<b>Good thing I bought a lot.</b>

13:44.510 --> 13:47.570
<b>We set up the festival for you, after all.</b>

13:47.840 --> 13:48.940
<b>But this...</b>

13:52.400 --> 13:54.020
<b>was supposed to be a surprise.</b>

13:55.440 --> 13:57.270
<b>I can tell you're being thoughtful.</b>

14:06.660 --> 14:08.110
<b>Welcome ba—</b>

14:08.970 --> 14:09.820
<b>What's wrong?</b>

14:11.500 --> 14:13.040
<b>He's not coming to the fireworks.</b>

14:24.850 --> 14:26.380
<b>What happened? Tell me.</b>

14:27.190 --> 14:28.290
<b>Nothing.</b>

14:28.870 --> 14:31.090
<b>Two guys going after Touko...</b>

14:31.620 --> 14:32.970
<b>What am I?</b>

14:33.810 --> 14:34.640
<b>Sorry.</b>

14:35.050 --> 14:36.960
<b>I don't want you to apologize.</b>

14:37.390 --> 14:39.770
<b>I know we can't just leave things like this.</b>

14:41.650 --> 14:42.520
<b>I'll figure it out.</b>

14:57.570 --> 14:59.050
<b>Want to come over?</b>

15:00.090 --> 15:01.040
<b>My father's home.</b>

15:02.010 --> 15:02.910
<b>Sure.</b>

15:07.890 --> 15:10.710
<b>These are all my CDs.</b>

15:10.710 --> 15:12.270
<b>I guess. I'm a fan.</b>

15:13.190 --> 15:14.200
<b>What's wrong?</b>

15:14.520 --> 15:15.380
<b>It's my mother.</b>

15:18.870 --> 15:20.920
<b>I'll head home for today.</b>

15:25.050 --> 15:25.820
<b>Touko.</b>

15:30.660 --> 15:32.200
<i>Have I found it?</i>

15:38.310 --> 15:40.210
<b>Your mom is that pianist—</b>

15:40.850 --> 15:42.020
<b>Where are we going?</b>

16:14.490 --> 16:16.210
<b>I feel calmer when I'm here.</b>

16:24.840 --> 16:25.960
<b>I know what you mean.</b>

16:27.490 --> 16:29.120
<b>What's your mother like?</b>

16:29.420 --> 16:30.520
<b>Well...</b>

16:30.870 --> 16:32.890
<b>I guess she's someone who 
doesn't stay in one place.</b>

16:33.330 --> 16:36.520
<b>I don't know if it's because of her 
work or because of her personality.</b>

16:36.520 --> 16:38.360
<b>She must be an active person.</b>

16:38.680 --> 16:40.000
<b>When I was young,</b>

16:40.000 --> 16:43.020
<b>it always looked like she was doing
 the right thing no matter what.</b>

16:43.630 --> 16:45.980
<b>I suppose that makes me a mama's boy.</b>

16:45.980 --> 16:47.020
<b>No way.</b>

16:47.020 --> 16:48.480
<b>Sometimes I feel that way, too.</b>

16:49.760 --> 16:51.330
<b>I called you twice already.</b>

16:52.150 --> 16:55.610
<b>Will you tell me what you 
were calling me about now?</b>

16:55.900 --> 16:59.270
<b>Sorry we couldn't talk either time.</b>

16:59.900 --> 17:02.320
<b>Sacchan's being hospitalized.</b>

17:02.620 --> 17:05.920
<b>She says it'll be fine, 
because it's just for tests.</b>

17:06.220 --> 17:08.380
<b>But I've seen her future, in the hospital.</b>

17:09.160 --> 17:10.430
<b>You're worried.</b>

17:10.430 --> 17:11.290
<b>Yeah.</b>

17:14.050 --> 17:14.930
<b>Sorry.</b>

17:15.720 --> 17:17.510
<b>Hello, Yuki-kun?</b>

17:18.020 --> 17:19.320
<i>Touko,</i>

17:19.680 --> 17:22.350
<i>sorry, there's something I 
need to talk to you about.</i>

17:22.730 --> 17:24.520
<b>About you punching Okikura-kun, right?</b>

17:24.910 --> 17:25.830
<b>You met up with him?</b>

17:26.320 --> 17:27.630
<b>I'm with him now.</b>

17:29.230 --> 17:31.870
<b>Come to the school yard. 
Let's settle this.</b>

17:35.980 --> 17:37.670
<b>You're on my side, right, Touko?</b>

17:38.370 --> 17:40.510
<i>Yana-chan, stop them!</i>

17:40.510 --> 17:43.330
<i>It'll get really bad if they meet!</i>

17:52.400 --> 17:54.340
<b>I apologize for punching you.</b>

17:54.820 --> 17:55.590
<b>My bad.</b>

18:02.950 --> 18:03.970
<b>Yana-chan.</b>

18:05.400 --> 18:07.440
<b>If you really think so,</b>

18:08.870 --> 18:10.230
<b>let's have a race.</b>

18:12.390 --> 18:14.410
<b>We have a perfect field here.</b>

18:17.980 --> 18:19.000
<b>Run?</b>

18:19.300 --> 18:20.770
<b>You? Against me?</b>

18:21.580 --> 18:24.330
<b>Running is about the only thing you 
can take seriously, is it not?</b>

18:25.990 --> 18:29.400
<b>If you win, I'll never see Touko again.</b>

18:30.340 --> 18:32.870
<b>If I win, Touko is mine.</b>

18:33.940 --> 18:35.880
<b>You have Takayama.</b>

18:35.880 --> 18:37.380
<b>I don't mind if you lose on purpose.</b>

18:50.360 --> 18:52.320
<b>You don't even intend to run, do you?</b>

18:52.620 --> 18:54.390
<b>I don't know what you're after,</b>

18:54.390 --> 18:57.280
<b>but you're the worst for 
what you chose to do!</b>

19:01.170 --> 19:02.090
<b>Let's go.</b>

19:16.590 --> 19:17.450
<b>Let them go!</b>

19:28.610 --> 19:30.880
<b>Fireworks festival postponed?</b>

19:30.880 --> 19:33.330
<b>Maybe David-kun couldn't make it.</b>

19:36.360 --> 19:38.450
<b>How about just a mini-fireworks festival?</b>

19:43.760 --> 19:45.780
<b>Is it true what Yana-chan said?</b>

19:46.080 --> 19:48.470
<b>Yeah, I never intended to run.</b>

19:48.940 --> 19:51.070
<b>There's no way I could have won.</b>

19:51.460 --> 19:52.810
<b>Then why?</b>

19:53.400 --> 19:56.680
<b>What was I thinking, starting a fist fight?</b>

19:56.680 --> 19:58.300
<b>I don't know.</b>

19:58.920 --> 20:00.490
<b>That's awful.</b>

20:00.490 --> 20:02.930
<b>That doesn't explain anything.</b>

20:03.590 --> 20:04.550
<b>It doesn't.</b>

20:05.250 --> 20:08.400
<b>Maybe I just wanted you to say</b>

20:08.400 --> 20:09.930
<b>that you're on my side.</b>

20:11.620 --> 20:14.950
<b>What are the future fragments to you, Touko?</b>

20:17.070 --> 20:20.400
<b>Preparation so I can enjoy things twice?</b>

20:21.760 --> 20:23.280
<b>You sure are interesting.</b>

20:26.760 --> 20:30.440
<b>I called them "fragments" 
of the future because</b>

20:30.440 --> 20:34.210
<b>they seemed like pieces 
of me that were missing.</b>

20:35.090 --> 20:36.560
<b>Pieces that I need</b>

20:36.560 --> 20:39.350
<b>to make my fractured self solid and whole.</b>

20:40.420 --> 20:41.880
<b>But those pieces were</b>

20:41.880 --> 20:45.170
<b>just weak sounds or voices.</b>

20:45.460 --> 20:47.100
<b>Nothing more.</b>

20:48.580 --> 20:49.810
<b>Until I met you.</b>

20:51.350 --> 20:53.140
<b>I'm slowly starting to understand.</b>

20:53.780 --> 20:55.280
<b>What I want</b>

20:55.580 --> 20:58.130
<b>isn't those mysterious pieces.</b>

20:58.870 --> 21:00.370
<b>It must be something clearer,</b>

21:00.370 --> 21:03.020
<b>more tangible.</b>

21:03.340 --> 21:04.540
<b>Do you mean—</b>

21:08.600 --> 21:10.380
<b>All I can hear is</b>

21:11.190 --> 21:12.450
<b>your voice.</b>

21:26.230 --> 21:30.030
<b>I keep seeing you, too.</b>

21:30.920 --> 21:33.450
<b>Have I found it?</b>

23:29.400 --> 23:30.990
<b>I don't like David.</b>

23:30.990 --> 23:32.050
<b>The future can't be changed.</b>

23:32.050 --> 23:33.920
<b>What is my relationship with Kakeru-kun?</b>

23:33.920 --> 23:35.410
<b>I'm going home for now.</b>

23:35.310 --> 23:38.560
<b>Episode 7
 "Bicycle"</b>

23:35.410 --> 23:38.270
<b>Please don't look bad.</b>
